{"id":"n29712-6-7","stage":0,"title":"모르다 · 难以言表","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29712-6-7-1","ko":"아이들한테 크리스마스 선물 주셨어요?","zh":"您给孩子们送圣诞礼物了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이들한테","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들한테","audio":"/audio/d29d1d25b29e7c2ea162.mp3"}},{"text":"크리스마스","meaning":"圣诞节","explanation":"크리스마스：圣诞节。","readings":[{"term":"크리스마스","audio":"/audio/44edd2070a34cf676b80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32793","senseId":"1","lemma":"크리스마스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크리스마스","audio":"/audio/44edd2070a34cf676b80.mp3"}},{"text":"선물","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}},{"text":"주셨어요?","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주셨어요","audio":"/audio/adc69b414b2bbfb81df6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"44edd2070a34cf67","term":"크리스마스","zh":"圣诞节","audio":"/audio/44edd2070a34cf676b80.mp3","entryId":"32793","definition":"纪念基督教创始人耶稣诞生的日子，12月25日。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a107a52b78d783a4983.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29712-6-7-2","ko":"네, 아이들이 얼마나 좋아했는지 몰라요.","zh":"送了，孩子们可高兴了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"아이들이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들이","audio":"/audio/ac32747784d62b1df40f.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아했는지","meaning":"高兴成什么样","explanation":"좋아하다（高兴）＋-었-（过去）＋-는지（程度或内容）；与后面的 모르다 合用，加强“特别高兴”的语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"5","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아했는지","audio":"/audio/44c9f066925a5611c6f9.mp3"}},{"text":"몰라요.","meaning":"别提有多……了","explanation":"在“얼마나 …-는지 모르다”中，모르다 并非真的“不知道”，而是强调程度高得难以言表。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"6","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰라요","audio":"/audio/0d692ebb8eba98e28650.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"欢喜，高兴","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"表现出开心愉快的感情。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"难以言表；这里表示非常高兴","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"难以言表；这里表示非常高兴","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad2a566286bd1473d94d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29712","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"초급","day":12,"sequenceScore":0.2765,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您给孩子们送圣诞礼物了吗？","送了，孩子们可高兴了。","我们喝一杯怎么样？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您给孩子们送圣诞礼物了吗？","送了，孩子们可高兴了。","我们喝一杯怎么样？"],"answer":1}]}
